  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This small can of stinging spray is commonly used as a one-time defense to get away from dangerous people. As an action, a creature can spray stinging fluid at a creature up to 10 feet away. The target must succeed on a DC 10 Constitution saving throw or be blinded for 3 rounds. At the end of each of its turns, the target can repeat the saving throw. On a successful save, the blindness ends. One the spray is used like this, the can is empty.</p>",
